531
00:35:49.240 --> 00:35:50.240
WHISPERS: Charlie.

532
00:35:51.520 --> 00:35:52.776
Charlie?

533
00:35:52.800 --> 00:35:54.056
Mm.

534
00:35:54.080 --> 00:35:55.800
I think I might've found something.

535
00:36:17.400 --> 00:36:19.440
RINGING

536
00:36:22.240 --> 00:36:24.280
PHONE RINGS

537
00:36:27.680 --> 00:36:29.400
RINGING

538
00:36:33.920 --> 00:36:34.920
Hey there.

539
00:36:37.880 --> 00:36:38.880
Hi.

540
00:36:40.520 --> 00:36:41.520
Where are you?

541
00:36:43.040 --> 00:36:46.880
Um... I was on my way home.
but I got called back in.

542
00:36:48.840 --> 00:36:49.840
You?

543
00:36:51.040 --> 00:36:52.336
I just got home.

544
00:36:52.360 --> 00:36:54.376
I picked the boys up on the way.

545
00:36:54.400 --> 00:36:55.696
ordered pizza.

546
00:36:55.720 --> 00:36:57.200
They're just doing their homework.

547
00:36:59.800 --> 00:37:01.296
How was London?

548
00:37:01.320 --> 00:37:02.320
Fine.

549
00:37:05.280 --> 00:37:07.680
And your talks
with the special advisers?

550
00:37:10.560 --> 00:37:11.560
Fine.

551
00:37:13.560 --> 00:37:14.696
I got your message.

552
00:37:14.720 --> 00:37:16.560
Sorry I couldn't pick up. I. um...

553
00:37:19.960 --> 00:37:21.416
What time are you home?

554
00:37:21.440 --> 00:37:22.960
Uh. I can't say.

555
00:37:25.240 --> 00:37:26.856
Danny? Let's...

556
00:37:26.880 --> 00:37:28.240
Let's talk later. OK?

557
00:37:29.240 --> 00:37:30.600
Love you. Yep. Got to go.

558
00:37:53.440 --> 00:37:55.240
Fucking hell.
how long is it going to be?

559
00:37:56.760 --> 00:37:57.936
Nice friends -

560
00:37:57.960 --> 00:38:01.560
they prefer to talk about business
with CCP than help you out.

561
00:38:05.200 --> 00:38:06.320
Saara won't let me down.

562
00:38:07.640 --> 00:38:09.120
Is she your girlfriend? No.

563
00:38:11.120 --> 00:38:12.960
I mean. no. she's not.

564
00:38:20.200 --> 00:38:21.200
Magic.

565
00:38:22.440 --> 00:38:23.600
I don't understand.

566
00:38:25.040 --> 00:38:26.336
Balaclava.

567
00:38:26.360 --> 00:38:28.896
so you can get from
here to the car.

568
00:38:28.920 --> 00:38:31.720
or whatever it is your friends
decide to send for you.

569
00:38:33.920 --> 00:38:34.920
Thank you.

570
00:38:36.400 --> 00:38:39.280
Thank me in Bitcoin.
not flower boy eyes.

571
00:38:41.080 --> 00:38:42.640
Is that a compliment or an insult?

572
00:38:44.440 --> 00:38:45.440
Insult.

573
00:38:48.880 --> 00:38:51.560
Put it on now
so I don't have to look at you.

574
00:39:02.240 --> 00:39:05.200
Wow. you look better already.

575
00:39:08.960 --> 00:39:11.720
HEAVY METAL MUSIC PLAYS

576
00:39:16.600 --> 00:39:19.680
HAI YELLS

577
00:39:21.960 --> 00:39:24.480
THEY YELL

578
00:39:43.000 --> 00:39:45.176
This completes the list of

579
00:39:45.200 --> 00:39:46.976
all the times
the MAC address was accessed.

580
00:39:47.000 --> 00:39:48.296
It was actually
quite easy in the end.

581
00:39:48.320 --> 00:39:49.776
I dumped the RAM

582
00:39:49.800 --> 00:39:52.280
and examined the raw data
using memory forensics.

583
00:39:53.720 --> 00:39:54.760
Yes. that's the full list.

584
00:39:56.240 --> 00:39:58.776
And only one falls
into our time period

585
00:39:58.800 --> 00:40:02.936
of October. 2022. 10.51.

586
00:40:02.960 --> 00:40:05.360
So now we just need to
cross-reference.

587
00:40:10.360 --> 00:40:11.360
No.

588
00:40:14.040 --> 00:40:15.360
I can't believe I just did that.

589
00:40:18.720 --> 00:40:20.080
You did your job.

590
00:40:24.200 --> 00:40:26.600
TAPS PHONE KEYPAD

591
00:40:28.960 --> 00:40:30.256
Maya. Boss.

592
00:40:30.280 --> 00:40:31.656
I need you here.

593
00:40:31.680 --> 00:40:33.960
And get Joanna from MI6...

594
00:40:35.120 --> 00:40:37.200
and I think Phil Draper's
going to need a lawyer.

595
00:40:43.120 --> 00:40:44.120
DOOR SHUTS

596
00:40:49.880 --> 00:40:51.136
How bad?

597
00:40:51.160 --> 00:40:52.736
The threat level has escalated.

598
00:40:52.760 --> 00:40:56.296
The whole financial services sector
will soon be in meltdown.

599
00:40:56.320 --> 00:40:57.816
And the malware is irreversible?

600
00:40:57.840 --> 00:40:59.976
Not that we can determine as yet.

601
00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:02.336
DANNY SIGHS

602
00:41:02.360 --> 00:41:04.256
Close down the system -

603
00:41:04.280 --> 00:41:07.056
Departments of Immigration.
Trade and all contiguous systems.

604
00:41:07.080 --> 00:41:08.616
But Marston said...
To hell with Marston.

605
00:41:08.640 --> 00:41:11.336
The man is a posturing idiot.

606
00:41:11.360 --> 00:41:14.576
Perhaps. but can we. legally.

607
00:41:14.600 --> 00:41:16.816
without ministerial sign-off?

608
00:41:16.840 --> 00:41:19.256
The Intelligence Act of 1994 -

609
00:41:19.280 --> 00:41:21.736
senior officials can organise
preliminary actions

610
00:41:21.760 --> 00:41:24.040
in the national interest
without ministerial approval.

611
00:41:25.160 --> 00:41:27.216
If anyone questions you. it's on me.

612
00:41:27.240 --> 00:41:30.216
There has been travel chaos
across the UK today

613
00:41:30.240 --> 00:41:31.816
after the Department
of Immigration's

614
00:41:31.840 --> 00:41:33.136
computer system went down.

615
00:41:33.160 --> 00:41:35.696
Airports. ferry terminals and
the Eurostar were all affected.

616
00:41:35.720 --> 00:41:38.896
There is growing suspicion that
hackers from a hostile nation state

617
00:41:38.920 --> 00:41:40.696
may be behind the disruption.

618
00:41:40.720 --> 00:41:43.016
The lawyers at Trade and
Industry were writing

619
00:41:43.040 --> 00:41:45.976
key paragraphs in the agreement
when you pulled the plug.

620
00:41:46.000 --> 00:41:47.496
It was necessary.

621
00:41:47.520 --> 00:41:49.536
You should have consulted us.

622
00:41:49.560 --> 00:41:51.736
I did - you said no.

623
00:41:51.760 --> 00:41:53.336
I was within my rights as Direc...

624
00:41:53.360 --> 00:41:54.856
That's as may be.

625
00:41:54.880 --> 00:41:56.416
but the PM's exact words were.

626
00:41:56.440 --> 00:41:58.856
"I'll have Danny Patrick for this."

627
00:41:58.880 --> 00:42:02.016
Well. the Public
and Commercial Services Union

628
00:42:02.040 --> 00:42:03.336
will have something
to say about that.

629
00:42:03.360 --> 00:42:05.856
You do realise it's chaos out there.
don't you?

630
00:42:05.880 --> 00:42:07.456
It was chaos before.

631
00:42:07.480 --> 00:42:09.016
At least now it's confined.

632
00:42:09.040 --> 00:42:11.536
We need to turn the system on again
as soon as possible. Danny.

633
00:42:11.560 --> 00:42:14.296
The risk of contagion is too great.

634
00:42:14.320 --> 00:42:16.856
This is a potentially nuclear
piece of malware.

635
00:42:16.880 --> 00:42:19.640
Until we understand it.
those departments remain isolated.

636
00:42:23.440 --> 00:42:25.016
Well. I hope you're right. Danny.

637
00:42:25.040 --> 00:42:26.040
I am.

638
00:42:30.440 --> 00:42:31.600
Some blowback.

639
00:42:33.800 --> 00:42:35.400
Someone had to make the right call.

640
00:42:37.400 --> 00:42:38.936
Look. you've been here all day.

641
00:42:38.960 --> 00:42:40.816
I'll do the night shift.
you go get some sleep.

642
00:42:40.840 --> 00:42:42.080
Are you sure? Yeah.

643
00:42:43.440 --> 00:42:46.960
Just come in with
a brilliant solution tomorrow.

644
00:42:50.080 --> 00:42:51.080
You know...

645
00:42:52.160 --> 00:42:55.680
the reason MI6 are here
is because...

646
00:42:57.720 --> 00:42:58.840
we've got a mole.

647
00:43:01.960 --> 00:43:02.960
It could be anyone...

648
00:43:04.040 --> 00:43:06.040
but they think they've
got the right person now.

649
00:43:08.040 --> 00:43:12.080
Well. thanks for trusting me
enough to tell me.

650
00:43:16.200 --> 00:43:18.040
DOOR OPENS

651
00:44:04.440 --> 00:44:07.256
You've been read your rights.
Phil. do you understand?

652
00:44:07.280 --> 00:44:08.520
Yes.

653
00:44:10.600 --> 00:44:12.280
And I didn't betray my country.

654
00:44:17.040 --> 00:44:18.640
This is a timestamped log...

655
00:44:19.840 --> 00:44:23.096
of the missing MAC address
access records.

656
00:44:23.120 --> 00:44:26.200
which proves the MAC address
was stolen on your login.

657
00:44:33.720 --> 00:44:35.576
No. this... This isn't right.

658
00:44:35.600 --> 00:44:36.976
There must be a mistake.

659
00:44:37.000 --> 00:44:38.856
I need to see the
Malware work calendar

660
00:44:38.880 --> 00:44:40.360
to see what we were working on.

661
00:44:44.480 --> 00:44:46.016
RINGING

662
00:44:46.040 --> 00:44:47.616
Boss? Maya.

663
00:44:47.640 --> 00:44:48.976
could you see if anyone in Malware

664
00:44:49.000 --> 00:44:50.376
can supply us with
their work calendar?

665
00:44:50.400 --> 00:44:51.520
Matter of urgency.

666
00:45:05.240 --> 00:45:06.936
"Laughing Panda"?

667
00:45:06.960 --> 00:45:10.176
"Malware Attack. Chinese. APT10."

668
00:45:10.200 --> 00:45:12.616
We went into surge mode
for a good two weeks.

669
00:45:12.640 --> 00:45:13.640
How is that relevant?

670
00:45:16.160 --> 00:45:17.400
What have you got for me?

671
00:45:18.920 --> 00:45:20.296
It's Phil. isn't it?

672
00:45:20.320 --> 00:45:21.560
It can't be.

673
00:45:23.200 --> 00:45:24.616
Can't be what?

674
00:45:24.640 --> 00:45:26.160
Barbara Napier.

675
00:45:27.680 --> 00:45:29.200
She asked me to get her a coffee.

676
00:45:30.600 --> 00:45:31.760
I left her at the terminal...

677
00:45:32.880 --> 00:45:34.256
I went down to the coffee van.

678
00:45:34.280 --> 00:45:37.456
I must've been gone
a good ten. 15 minutes.

679
00:45:37.480 --> 00:45:39.616
But it was Danny Patrick's wife.
the boss.

680
00:45:39.640 --> 00:45:41.016
Barbara Napier.

681
00:45:41.040 --> 00:45:42.176
You wouldn't be an angel

682
00:45:42.200 --> 00:45:44.696
and get me a latte
from the coffee van. would you?

683
00:45:44.720 --> 00:45:46.520
Here. have one yourself.

684
00:45:47.760 --> 00:45:49.656
Barbara Napier? Yeah.

685
00:45:49.680 --> 00:45:53.120
I don't know why they sent the most
senior analyst on the China Team...

686
00:45:54.280 --> 00:45:55.440
but it was Danny's wife...

687
00:45:56.400 --> 00:45:57.496
the boss -

688
00:45:57.520 --> 00:45:59.056
of course I got her a coffee.

689
00:45:59.080 --> 00:46:02.560
These are very serious allegations
you're making here. Phil...

690
00:46:04.320 --> 00:46:07.816
about a senior and
widely respected colleague.

691
00:46:07.840 --> 00:46:09.680
I'm not making allegations...

692
00:46:11.520 --> 00:46:12.840
I'm just saying what happened.

693
00:47:12.600 --> 00:47:15.800
